  <name>Cloudberry</name>
  <developer id="io.github.nishiki001">
    <name>nishiki001</name>
  </developer>
  <summary>Unofficial desktop client for YouTube Music</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Cloudberry is a fast, native desktop music player in the style of the classic players: a sidebar, a toolbar with a live spectrum analyzer, playlist tabs and a sortable table.</p>
    <p>It is an unofficial client for YouTube Music and is not affiliated with, endorsed by or sponsored by Google.</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Search, your library, playlists, Discover, artist and album pages</li>
      <li>Synced lyrics, a spectrum analyzer driven by the real audio, a mini player</li>
      <li>Classic and glossy Aero skins, three icon sets, your own fonts and colours</li>
      <li>Media keys and the desktop media widget (MPRIS)</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.nishiki001.Cloudberry.desktop</launchable>
